values ('ally_corvan', 'CORVAN_STEEL', 'Corvan Steel', 'Epic', 'Tank', 'The Hegemony''s most decorated siege-breaker, Corvan voluntarily underwent a classified augmentation project that replaced his skeleton with an experimental titanite alloy. He survived. Most of the project team didn''t. He defected the day he learned why.', 'Titan Assembly Yard', 'IRON_HEGEMONY', '{"hp": 185, "mp": 60, "atk": 110, "def": 165, "agi": 55, "per": 75}'::jsonb, 'al_corvan_pas', 'al_corvan_act', 2, 55, 0.83, 3, 13)
