values ('ally_thorn', 'THORN_VALE', 'Thorn Vale', 'Uncommon', 'Tank', 'A civil engineering officer turned front-line soldier after a Void incursion levelled the district he was rebuilding. Thorn fights with the stubborn permanence of concrete — not fast, not flashy, but nothing moves him.', 'Cradle Outer Ring', 'CONCORDIUM', '{"hp": 155, "mp": 55, "atk": 95, "def": 135, "agi": 60, "per": 75}'::jsonb, 'al2_thorn_pas', 'al2_thorn_act', 1, 45, 0.97, 1, 20)
