values ('ally_lila', 'LILA_SUNBLOOM', 'Lila Sunbloom', 'Common', 'Healer', 'Lila inherited her grandmother''s herb-drying racks and a handwritten ledger of remedies older than the Shard Fracture itself. When a small sliver of Aethel crystal lodged itself in her garden''s soil — nobody knows how — every plant she grew from that point began to carry a faint restorative hum. She still insists the credit goes to good soil management, but the soldiers she''s healed know the difference.', 'Verdant Hollow, Children''s Territory', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', '{"hp": 98, "mp": 132, "atk": 48, "def": 84, "agi": 82, "per": 125}'::jsonb, 'al5_64_pas', 'al5_64_act', 1, 40, 1.0, 1, 63)
