values ('ally_cole', 'COLE_STEELMARK', 'Cole Steelmark', 'Uncommon', 'Support', 'OmniCorp''s hardware division built some of the finest field equipment in operation — Cole Steelmark designed a third of it, from the bench. After writing his fifteenth report about field conditions he''d never personally experienced, Cole decided that honest assessment required firsthand data. He submitted a field assessment request, was denied, and went anyway. His equipment reports improved dramatically as a result.', 'The Spire, OmniCorp Hardware Division', 'OMNICORP', '{"hp": 88, "mp": 138, "atk": 62, "def": 78, "agi": 96, "per": 128}'::jsonb, 'al5_75_pas', 'al5_75_act', 1, 45, 0.97, 1, 74)
