values ('ally_tessa', 'TESSA_GRAY', 'Tessa Gray', 'Uncommon', 'DPS', 'Tessa spent five years as a Concordium intelligence analyst, mapping enemy patterns and predicting engagements with unusual accuracy. Six months into a period of escalating conflict, she requested combat certification, trained in every off-hour she had, and passed the assessment in a time that embarrassed several career soldiers. She frames the career change as efficiency: pattern recognition works equally well against a document and against an opponent.', 'Nexus Core, Intelligence Bureau', 'CONCORDIUM', '{"hp": 88, "mp": 88, "atk": 125, "def": 70, "agi": 125, "per": 105}'::jsonb, 'al5_76_pas', 'al5_76_act', 1, 45, 0.97, 1, 75)
