values ('ally_dane', 'DANE_HOLLOWS', 'Dane Hollows', 'Uncommon', 'Tank', 'Dane has held Post 7 at the Iron Hegemony''s eastern border wall through three separate incursions, each one clearing the post of every other soldier. Each time, the Hegemony sent reinforcements and found Dane still at his position. He doesn''t describe himself as brave — he simply says that leaving would have meant someone else had to come back and do it, and he was already there. He has held Post 7 for eleven years total.', 'Eastern Border Wall, Iron Hegemony', 'IRON_HEGEMONY', '{"hp": 160, "mp": 56, "atk": 93, "def": 140, "agi": 58, "per": 76}'::jsonb, 'al5_77_pas', 'al5_77_act', 1, 45, 0.97, 1, 76)
