values ('ally_gareth', 'GARETH_NULL', 'Gareth Null', 'Rare', 'Tank', 'OmniCorp''s executive protection division assigned Gareth to a sequence of corporate principals whose safety he maintained flawlessly for eight years. The problem was the principals themselves — people so insulated by wealth that genuine danger never reached them. Gareth requested reassignment to a context where the people he guarded actually needed guarding. The request was denied. He left anyway and has not looked back at a single corporate tower since.', 'The Spire, OmniCorp Executive Tier', 'OMNICORP', '{"hp": 170, "mp": 56, "atk": 100, "def": 148, "agi": 62, "per": 78}'::jsonb, 'al5_80_pas', 'al5_80_act', 2, 50, 0.93, 2, 79)
