values ('ally_sable', 'SABLE_NOIR', 'Sable Noir', 'Rare', 'Support', 'Sable Noir ran the Meridian Cartel''s intelligence apparatus for eleven years, maintaining a network of assets across six factions simultaneously without a single exposure event. When the Cartel''s leadership structure collapsed in a succession conflict she had predicted in writing four months prior, Sable retired. Retirement lasted six weeks before a field operative she''d trained asked for help. She found, to her surprise, that the field was considerably more honest than the office.', 'Port Meridian, Cartel Intelligence Bureau', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', '{"hp": 92, "mp": 138, "atk": 68, "def": 86, "agi": 108, "per": 142}'::jsonb, 'al5_81_pas', 'al5_81_act', 2, 50, 0.93, 2, 80)
