values ('ally_marn', 'MARN_WELD', 'Marn Weld', 'Rare', 'Tank', 'Arcanum Seekers theorists write papers about defensive rune configurations; Marn Weld etches them directly onto his own skin and walks into live fire to check the results. His colleagues consider this methodology irresponsible. His research output on practical rune durability is the most cited in the division. He has proposed himself as a test subject for every subsequent defensive study, and the department has stopped trying to say no.', 'Arcanum Seekers Field Research Division', 'THE_ARCANUM_SEEKERS', '{"hp": 168, "mp": 58, "atk": 102, "def": 150, "agi": 60, "per": 80}'::jsonb, 'al5_84_pas', 'al5_84_act', 2, 50, 0.93, 2, 83)
