values ('ally_zola', 'ZOLA_KAST', 'Zola Kast', 'Rare', 'Healer', 'When the Concordium assigned Zola to District 14 medical operations, she was given resources rated for one hundred patients. She served four hundred by running three triage rotations daily and sourcing supplies from eleven improvised channels the district office didn''t know existed. Her quarterly reports were masterpieces of creative accounting. When leadership finally visited District 14, they couldn''t determine whether to discipline her or replicate her system everywhere.', 'District 14, Concordium Sector', 'CONCORDIUM', '{"hp": 108, "mp": 152, "atk": 56, "def": 88, "agi": 90, "per": 142}'::jsonb, 'al5_85_pas', 'al5_85_act', 2, 50, 0.93, 2, 84)
